{
  "executive_abstract": "August production missed targets by 140 units due to equipment downtime and material shortages from a primary supplier. The defect rate exceeded targets, and a key client delivery is delayed by nine days. Recovery actions include an emergency material order, an extra Saturday shift, and daily equipment calibration checks. Management is actively monitoring these recovery steps to protect customer commitments and reduce the order backlog by late September."
}

